_opu_xtn","predicate":"agnatic_cousin","qualifiers":{"source_term":"臣從弟祗"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-060","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan","source_id":"s-jinshu-060-lihan-ws2413335","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p004","quote":"又含自以隴西人，雖戶屬始平，非所綜悉。自初見使為中正，反復言辭，說非始平國人，不宜為中正。後為郎中令，又自以選官引臺府為比，以讓常山太守蘇韶，辭意懇切，形于文墨。含之固讓，乃在王未薨之前，葬後躊躇，窮於對罰而攝職耳。臣從弟祗為州都，意在欲隆風教，議含已過，不良之人遂相扇動，冀挾名義，法外致案，足有所邀，中正龐騰便割含品。臣雖無祁大夫之德，見含為騰所侮，謹表以聞，乞朝廷以時博議，無令騰得妄弄刀尺。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p004:m0111","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p004:m0108"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"傅咸上表稱祗為從弟。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-jin076-wangbin-46-20","person_id":"6x2_7cd_tw2","title":"光祿大夫","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-076","source_id":"s-jinshu-076-wangbin","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line046","quote":"彬字世儒。少稱雅正，弱冠，不就州郡之命。光祿大夫傅祗辟為掾。後與兄廙俱渡江，為揚州刺史劉機建武長史。元帝引為鎮東賊曹參軍，轉典兵參軍。豫討華軼功，封都亭侯，湣帝召為尚書郎，以道險不就。遷建安太守，徙義興內史，未之職，轉軍諮祭酒。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line046:m0024"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-jin076-wangbin-46-20:a001","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line046","start":20,"end":24,"surface":"光祿大夫","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line046:m0024","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"只按本段任命、轉任、降職或見稱保存；未知起訖留空，不以卒年終止全部稱號，也不把府主職位作受任者本官。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-1-84","title":"晉司徒","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"6x2_7cd_tw2","attestations":[{"id":"th-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-1-84:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p001","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"晉司徒","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p001:m0087","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-048","chapter_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-ws1791560","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p001","quote":"傅弘之字仲度，北地泥陽人。傅氏舊屬靈州，漢末郡境為虜所侵，失土寄寓馮翊，置泥陽、富平二縣，靈州廢不立，故傅氏悉屬泥陽。晉武帝太康三年，復立靈州縣，傅氏還屬靈州。弘之高祖晉司徒祗，後封靈州公，不欲封本縣，故祗一門還復泥陽。曾祖暢，祕書丞，沒胡，生子洪，晉穆帝永和中，胡亂得還。洪生韶，梁州刺史，散騎常侍。韶生弘之。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p001:m0087"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"th-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-1-91","title":"靈州公","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"attestation","person_id":"6x2_7cd_tw2","attestations":[{"id":"th-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-1-91:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p001","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"靈州公","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p001:m0087","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-048","chapter_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-ws1791560","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p001","quote":"傅弘之字仲度，北地泥陽人。傅氏舊屬靈州，漢末郡境為虜所侵，失土寄寓馮翊，置泥陽、富平二縣，靈州廢不立，故傅氏悉屬泥陽。晉武帝太康三年，復立靈州縣，傅氏還屬靈州。弘之高祖晉司徒祗，後封靈州公，不欲封本縣，故祗一門還復泥陽。曾祖暢，祕書丞，沒胡，生子洪，晉穆帝永和中，胡亂得還。洪生韶，梁州刺史，散騎常侍。韶生弘之。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p001:m0087"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005","text":"楷子瓚娶楊駿女，然楷素輕駿，與之不平。駿既執政，乃轉為衛尉，遷太子少師，優遊無事，默如也。及駿誅，楷以婚親收付廷尉，將加法。是日事倉卒，誅戮縱橫，眾人為之震恐。楷容色不變，舉動自若，索紙筆與親故書。賴侍中傅祗救護得免，猶坐去官。太保衛瓘、太宰亮稱楷貞正不阿附，宜蒙爵土，乃封臨海侯，食邑二千戶。代楚王瑋為北軍中候，加散騎常侍。瑋怨瓘、亮斥己任楷，楷聞之，不敢拜，轉為尚書。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"530_f9d_4bd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"瓚","kind":"person","person_id":"99p_632_txb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"楊駿","kind":"person","person_id":"603_131_11e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"女","kind":"person","person_id":"wpv_w1b_yvx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"530_f9d_4bd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"駿","kind":"person","person_id":"603_131_11e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"駿","kind":"person","person_id":"603_131_11e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"駿","kind":"person","person_id":"603_131_11e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"530_f9d_4bd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"530_f9d_4bd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0102","start":102,"end